<title>USA: Nematron completes Virtual-Time purchase.</title>
<headline>Nematron completes Virtual-Time purchase.</headline>
<dateline>ANN ARBOR, Mich. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nematron Corp said Monday it completed its acquisition of Virtual-Time Software Inc for 67,500 shares of Nematron stock and $100,000 in cash.</p>
<p>VTS, based in San Jose, California, was merged into Nematron's Imagination Systems Inc subsidiary and will add its products to its existing real-time operating systems technology.</p>
<p>Shares of Nematron were up 1/4 at 6-1/4 Monday afternoon.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
